{"applicability_conditions":"标准电极电位（标准态条件，论文未明确说明温度、浓度等具体条件）。","identity":{"block_id":"b0102","equation_id":"equation_013","equation_number":"13","is_image":false,"latex_hint":"$$\n\\mathrm{Al} \\rightarrow \\mathrm{Al} ^ {3 +} + 3 \\mathrm{e} ^ {-} E ^ {\\circ} = - 1. 6 7 \\mathrm{V} _ {\\mathrm{SHE}}\\tag{13}\n$$","paper_id":"10.1016_j.corsci.2025.113331"},"latex":"\\mathrm{Al} \\rightarrow \\mathrm{Al} ^ {3 +} + 3 \\mathrm{e} ^ {-} E ^ {\\circ} = - 1. 6 7 \\mathrm{V} _ {\\mathrm{SHE}}\\tag{13}","purpose":"该式给出铝的阳极氧化半反应及其标准电极电位 E° = -1.67 V_SHE，用于定量表征 Al 失去电子发生氧化/阳极溶解的电化学倾向。","symbols":[{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"铝金属（反应物）","symbol":"Al","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"铝离子（氧化产物，+3 价）","symbol":"Al^{3+}","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"电子","symbol":"e^-","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"每摩尔 Al 氧化转移的电子数（化学计量系数）","symbol":"3","unit":null,"value":"3"},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"标准电极电位","symbol":"E^\\circ","unit":"V_SHE","value":"-1.67 V_SHE"},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"相对于标准氢电极（SHE）的伏特数，电极电位参考标度","symbol":"V_SHE","unit":"V","value":null}],"unmapped":["引用该式的正文指出：在 Al、Mn、Fe 三种元素中，Al 的标准电极电位最负，表明其失电子和阳极溶解倾向最高，为其氧化过程提供电化学驱动力；标准电极电位越负，金属氧化敏感性越大。"]}